And it appearing that the said rule was duly issued and served upon the respondent and that the time within which to file a return has expired;
It is ordered that the said Leonard N. Tarr be, and he is hereby, disbarred from the practice of law in this Court and that his name be stricken from the roll of attorneys admitted to practice before the Bar of this Court.
Mr. Justice Marshall took no part in the consideration or decision of this matter.

